<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill on Marsh &amp; McLennan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill on Marsh &amp; McLennan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch says downgrades near-term rating on Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Upgrades long-term rating to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
